  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMPASS 2015 Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is engaging 4 partners to conduct participatory research to include the voices of those living in poverty in the post-2015 debate. PRFT will conduct one of these research projects, building upon their Basic Needs Basket approach and their multi-year experience researching poverty in Zimbabwe. The research will be conducted in dialogue with the research coordinator based in London. The findings will be used for local and global advocacy purposes.</narrative>
  </description>
